# Every path requires @iamwatchdogs as an owner.
#
# The first non-comment line must be this whole-repo wildcard: a narrower first
# line leaves the rest with no required reviewer, and CODEOWNERS is read
# top-down.
* @iamwatchdogs

# The owners file gates itself, so an attacker cannot quietly reassign review.
.github/CODEOWNERS @iamwatchdogs

# Release and CI plumbing: a wrong change there is invisible until something
# ships. Explicit ownership is belt-and-braces with the wildcard, and documents
# the intent for the next reader.
/.github/workflows/ @iamwatchdogs
